                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "888d5f64-d54d-3fdc-b5b5-1d9f281f9e4e",
                        "entry_id": "1d72346d-7f6a-3506-ae58-75628f45656d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комната, занимаемая детьми (ребёнком), комната для детей (ребёнка)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9c6111b-3e24-4a95-a73c-4384e2e24917",
                                "sense_id": "888d5f64-d54d-3fdc-b5b5-1d9f281f9e4e",
                                "text": "Детская, Танина когда-то комната, выглядела давно уже подсобным помещением цветочного магазина."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18790647-2d14-461b-8e68-f315682c6e09",
                                "sense_id": "888d5f64-d54d-3fdc-b5b5-1d9f281f9e4e",
                                "text": ".. чтобы поставить точку, Михайлову нужно ещё спросить и записать: // — Вы не собираетесь в одно из гнёзд стенки вмонтировать телевизор? (Они потом могут поднять вой, что у них не всё как у Заруцких.) // — А вы как считаете? // — Если здесь детская, то не надо. Вы же захотите смотреть фигурное катание вечером. // — Да, да. Вы правы. // — Значит, решено — здесь детская? // — Да."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "795ffa57-c56e-3034-b612-8fd32ca9a5a8",
                        "entry_id": "1d72346d-7f6a-3506-ae58-75628f45656d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комплект мебели для такой комнаты"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b803abb7-6c01-4289-8dc6-708107b09567",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d72346d-7f6a-3506-ae58-75628f45656d",
                        "source_sense_description": "комната, занимаемая детьми (ребёнком), комната для детей (ребёнка)",
                        "target_lang_word": "nursery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nursery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1fc42748-d8dd-3eba-b3fc-6f2bafd84e1f",
                                        "entry_id": "50454636-f18b-36a9-b10c-3c9ad8be1540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where nursing (“breastfeeding”) or the raising of children is carried on.",
                                            "Especially in European countries: a room or area in a household set apart for the care of children."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9009b4f8-c631-442e-8245-a6345d52486f",
                                                "sense_id": "1fc42748-d8dd-3eba-b3fc-6f2bafd84e1f",
                                                "text": "As soon as she was alone and the carriage had been driven well away from the door, Mrs. Trevelyan left the drawing-room and went up to the nursery. As she entered she clothed her face with her sweetest smile. \"How is his own mother's dearest, dearest, darling duck?\" she said, putting out her arms and taking the boy from the nurse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "326b5371-b1bc-4747-9b48-82aba8d61cc7",
                                                "sense_id": "1fc42748-d8dd-3eba-b3fc-6f2bafd84e1f",
                                                "text": "But they had already discovered that he could be bullied, and they had it their own way; and presently Selwyn lay prone upon the nursery floor, impersonating a ladrone while pleasant shivers chased themselves over Drina, whom he was stalking."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a8b3da2-ad43-3bcc-aea2-abb5aa632fd1",
                                        "entry_id": "50454636-f18b-36a9-b10c-3c9ad8be1540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where nursing (“breastfeeding”) or the raising of children is carried on.",
                                            "An institution for small children who not yet have begun primary school during daytime (when their parents work); a daycare centre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "UK",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15e90c83-4688-3ea0-aeb4-2cd1ef78f919",
                                        "entry_id": "50454636-f18b-36a9-b10c-3c9ad8be1540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where nursing (“breastfeeding”) or the raising of children is carried on.",
                                            "The first year of pre-school."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Philippines",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "250beae9-7db6-3187-8c49-0ac6f20572fc",
                                        "entry_id": "50454636-f18b-36a9-b10c-3c9ad8be1540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where anything is fostered and growth promoted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a53f0f7a-051f-4774-bc5f-2ae2a08331ba",
                                                "sense_id": "250beae9-7db6-3187-8c49-0ac6f20572fc",
                                                "text": "[S]ince for the great deſire I had\n To ſee faire Padua, nurſerie of Arts,\n I am arriu'd for fruitfull Lombardie,\n The pleaſant garden of great Italy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be248bc1-4f6e-4747-9922-e11413c1202b",
                                                "sense_id": "250beae9-7db6-3187-8c49-0ac6f20572fc",
                                                "text": "Playes are the nurseries of vice, the bawd, / That thorow the senses steales our hearts abroad, / Tainting our eares with obscæne bawdery, / Lascivious words, and wanton ribaulry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cb2043a-f87e-4a43-ac82-86be9165ca40",
                                                "sense_id": "250beae9-7db6-3187-8c49-0ac6f20572fc",
                                                "text": "Nudgee College is regarded as the greatest rugby nursery in Queensland, with the boys in the blue-and-white butcher's stripes winning more Greater Public School rugby premierships than any other team."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "587dab78-6269-3113-8802-f391b8c8ee3f",
                                        "entry_id": "50454636-f18b-36a9-b10c-3c9ad8be1540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where anything is fostered and growth promoted.",
                                            "A place where animals breed, or where young animals are naturally or artificially reared (for example, on a farm)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30d2a1b5-3e43-3336-8da7-742b9bf9f4d3",
                                        "entry_id": "50454636-f18b-36a9-b10c-3c9ad8be1540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where anything is fostered and growth promoted.",
                                            "A place where young shrubs, trees, vines, etc., are cultivated for transplanting, or (more generally) made available for public sale, a garden centre; also (obsolete) a plantation of young trees."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f96c692-76f5-470a-8cdd-6a974713034a",
                                                "sense_id": "30d2a1b5-3e43-3336-8da7-742b9bf9f4d3",
                                                "text": "[I]f we had but one skilful and diligent Nurſery-man, who had a complete Nurſery of all ſorts of good fruit, and of the beſt Vines that agree beſt with this Climate, and Mulberry Trees, and wholſom Trees for the avenues of Cities, Towns, and fair Manſions; That one ſuch Nurſery within ten or fifteen miles in all the Vales of theſe three united Kingdoms, would make all theſe Plantations ſpread apace, and amount to the value of Millions yearly. [...] I am ſure, that many in Wiltſhire, Hampſhire, Dorſetſhire, and Sommerſetſhire are obliged and the richer for the famous Garden of Wilton, and for the goodly Nurſeries about Saliſbury."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab0f7f09-3248-4285-95b0-5c55f20cc373",
                                                "sense_id": "30d2a1b5-3e43-3336-8da7-742b9bf9f4d3",
                                                "text": "Managers of small nurseries may also come into direct contact with the public, who may have complaints about invasive nursery plants or may want varieties that a nursery manager considers invasive. Thus, retail nursery managers have an important role in educating both the consumer public and the wholesale nursery sector in environmental weed issues."
                                            }
                                        ]
